<title>SOUTH KOREA: Dong Ah in Texas property project.</title>
<headline>Dong Ah in Texas property project.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's Dong Ah Construction Industrial Co and U.S.-based DV Capital Co have begun a $162.6 million joint project to develop a resort and residential complex in Texas, a Dong Ah statement said on Wednesday.  </p>
<p>Dong Ah will have a 70 percent stake in the project to build apartments, golf courses, condominiums and shopping areas on a land mass of 8.9 square km near Austin, the statement said.</p>
<p>It said the project would help meet increasing housing needs in Austin.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727-5646</p>
</text>
